  "description": "Glyph data for the Standard 14 fonts of Broadside: the Liberation 2.1.5 families (SIL Open Font License 1.1) standing in for Helvetica, Times and Courier, and the Foxit Symbol and Dingbats fonts from PDFium (BSD-3-Clause). Wire it in with options.UseStandard14Fonts() so pages that use non-embedded Standard 14 fonts render without system fonts. The metrics ship in the core; this package carries only the glyphs, unmodified. No native dependencies.",
